'''Candleflame''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2021 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2021|2021 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
It has a deep purple handle in the shape of an antique candlestick with a purple blade resembling a flame of a candle igniting from it, hence the name. On the surface of the handle below the blade is a beam of radiant purple light.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Candleflame]], which was found in the same box.
*It was a victim of [[The Candleflame Glitch (2021)]], causing [[Nikilis]] to ban people with ten or more of this item.
**This seems to have been removed, though, as there currently are players owning ten or more of this item.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

